      "Row 4 connector is 1J6-5 (pin 4 is key -- skipped in numbering).",
      "Columns 7 and 8 carry identical lamp names throughout -- symmetrical inserts on playfield/backbox fired from separate row drivers.",
      "SHUTTLE lamps (18-24) correspond directly to SHUTTLE switch targets (SW18-24).",
      "STATION lamps (25-31) correspond to STATION switch targets (SW25-31).",
      "USA lamps (38-40) correspond to USA switch targets (SW38-40).",
